Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.25,0:00:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\a6}"You are invited to an anonymous online meetup\Nexclusively for romance-bot owners."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.13,0:00:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\a6}"On the day of the event, please enter using\Nthe URL below."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.71,0:00:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}An email from an unknown sender...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.05,0:00:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I attend this, maybe I can learn where\NNadeshiko came from?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.97,0:00:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"ENTER"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.31,0:00:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Aha, you made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.77,0:00:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the owner meetup!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.90,0:00:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.57,0:00:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This feels so... ordinary!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.91,0:00:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So is yours a girl too then, Miss Miaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.95,0:00:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, y-yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.04,0:00:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.25,0:00:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Check out this pic! It came out so pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.42,0:00:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.88,0:00:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What sort of girl is yours, Miss Miaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.05,0:00:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, her name is Nadeshiko...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.51,0:01:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this girl... really a robot?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.64,0:01:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Her frame doesn't have any\Nmechanical parts at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.02,0:01:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's almost like...\N- Miss Miaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.56,0:01:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.85,0:01:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Nadeshiko looks totally adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.27,0:01:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And like she might start\Nspeaking at any moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.69,0:01:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but there are so many girls\Nwho aren't so good at the talking thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So then... Nadeshiko's...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.62,0:01:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}no ordinary romance-bot after all!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.42,0:01:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I didn't learn jack!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.30,0:01:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And the most shocking thing of all...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.93,0:01:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an9}"My doll hobby got so intense that\NI became a humanoid robot fanatic☆"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.22,0:01:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Apparently I'm the only pervert\Nout there having sex with their robot!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.27,0:01:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd hoped to learn a little\Nmore about Nadeshiko...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.10,0:01:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I could tell you all sorts\Nof things if you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.86,0:01:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Like about, say...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.98,0:01:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,About your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.95,0:01:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Akane...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.36,0:02:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's going on?!\NNadeshiko copied herself?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.70,0:02:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is she secretly a ninja-bot?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.54,0:02:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Akane...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.17,0:02:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.21,0:02:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't explain it, but...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.46,0:02:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}having her whispering in\Nboth my ears feels so good~{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.01,0:02:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you wanted\Nto know more about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.14,0:02:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So I thought I'd introduce you to my\Nvirtual functions you hadn't seen yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.52,0:02:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So then this black Nadeshiko is... virtual?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.44,0:02:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.36,0:02:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The sensation of being licked...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.19,0:02:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Of being sucked...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.15,0:02:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Are reproduced almost 100%.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.95,0:02:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You see? I'm not actually\Neven touching you anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.20,0:02:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's not enough for\Nme to simply sit and watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.17,0:02:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! I—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.59,0:02:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's her same old tricks again!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.85,0:03:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Akane?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.09,0:03:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(440,440)\fs33\bord2.5\blur0.5\b0\shad0\3c&HD0377A&\c&HF7FFFC&\fnA-OTF Shin Go Pro R\pos(1185,815)}Brought to you by ToonsHub
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.10,0:03:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\a1}What were the other\Nromance-bots like?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.68,0:03:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\a1}Oh, I got some photos.\NYou want to see them?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.56,0:03:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\a1}Yes, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.32,0:03:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This image...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.28,0:03:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if she noticed my little message.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.33,0:03:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been so long since\NI've seen dear Nadeshiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.79,0:03:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm suuuper looking forward to it!
